  "title": "Nutella Puff Pastry Christmas Tree",
  "description": "This spectacular Nutella Christmas tree made with puff pastry is perfect for parties. It's easier to make than you think with this step-by-step recipe!",
  "authors": [
    "geneviever"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-12-16T22:21:54-05:00",
