  "ingredients": [
    "1 (17.5 ounce) package frozen puff pastry, thawed",
    "4 tablespoons chocolate-hazelnut spread (such as Nutella®), or more to taste, at room temperature",
    "1 egg, lightly beaten"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out one puff pastry sheet into a large rectangle on a lightly floured surface and place on the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lEUQdynHZAsNsiWDTpe0AKn7LGY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256100-nutella-pastry-christmas-tree-VAT-step-02-8f5656668a0d49e8b209ee93ccef0504.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256100/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly score puff pastry into the shape of a Christmas tree (triangle) with a wide base. Spread chocolate-hazelnut spread over the triangle in a thin layer with the back of a spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_WOp-RVC4MdXvO5t3CBeuJFlGOw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256100-nutella-pastry-christmas-tree-VAT-step-03-38196eb9723f4eb8a8b3f32b62ba8954.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256100/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out the second sheet of puff pastry to a large rectangle and place on top of the first one. Carefully trace the shape of the chocolate-covered triangle underneath and cut out the Christmas tree shape and the trunk. Pull away excess pastry.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wOLbQ-mR6SDJ50Twd0s9-j1YwAI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256100-nutella-pastry-christmas-tree-VAT-step-04-1d6bb47d8e3a473d9af5f9787bac0942.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256100/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly score 2 lines down the middle of the triangle to form a tree trunk that is narrower at the top and gets wider towards the base. Using the trunk as a guide, cut branches into the sides of the triangle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wT4uow-3M2eprxzEg2rKiQBGyGU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256100-nutella-pastry-christmas-tree-VAT-step-05-8a8c751eb69440fb8c01ba87422cb5ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256100/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Twist the branches away from you, trying to get in 2 turns on the lower branches. Continue moving up the tree, twisting away from you as you go.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZlqYK3wsx7Pn63yBr4p8K8GH3F4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256100-nutella-pastry-christmas-tree-VAT-step-06-b9bd31349c094ab1a3da8232de021fc1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256100/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut a small star out of the excess pastry; place it on top of the tree. Brush the star and the whole tree with beaten egg.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PmY9dgNWj7R1j-3OnyMb0wt380g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256100-nutella-pastry-christmas-tree-VAT-step-07-f68397f6251744b3994d868df80aac84.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256100/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until puffy and golden brown, 12 to 15 minutes. Cool slightly, about 5 minutes. Slide onto a serving plate, using a piece of parchment paper if needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wXwjVMg8PFmx_w66kaCqyeq49O8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/256100-nutella-pastry-christmas-tree-VAT-step-08-3055c741dc1a43c0bbfed7196afba517.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256100/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
